{"id":"662262","name":"白贝焗虾","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662262/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白贝","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鲜虾剪去虾枪和去除虾线后洗净。","img":"images/662262/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"白贝清水洗净备用。","img":"images/662262/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜头剁碎，生姜切片备用。","img":"images/662262/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒜蓉放入碗中，加入适量蚝油。","img":"images/662262/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"淋上热油激发出香味，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/662262/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中热油放入姜片炒香。","img":"images/662262/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入白贝。","img":"images/662262/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将虾均匀铺上。","img":"images/662262/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"淋上蒜蓉酱。","img":"images/662262/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盖上中小火焗。","img":"images/662262/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"焗至白贝开口，虾变色，翻炒均匀，加入葱花即可。","img":"images/662262/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662262/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662262/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}